        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also impacted by federal and state laws and policies that require providers to enroll in the Medicare program before submitting any claims for services, to promptly report certain changes in its operations to the agencies that administer these programs, and to re-enroll in these programs when changes in direct or indirect ownership occur or in response to revalidation requests from Medicare.",
        "start_character": 81421,
